  "description": "Get ready to elevate your off-road adventures to new heights with the FS Pro 3 MTB—an eBike engineered for epic performance and unmatched maneuverability. Designed with a full suspension frame, powerful Mid-drive Ultra motor, and a specially designed MTB+ wheelset, this eBike is your ticket to conquering any terrain with ease.\nUnmatched Performance:\n\nFull Suspension Frame: Experience a smooth and comfortable ride, even on rough terrain, thanks to the full suspension frame.\n\nMid-drive Ultra Motor: Conquer hills and obstacles effortlessly with the powerful 1000W Bafang Ultra M620 Mid-drive Motor.\n\n27.5x3 MTB+ Wheelset: Enjoy superior maneuverability and control on any trail, with the specially designed MTB+ wheelset.\n\nFeatures:\n\nPowerful Torque: With 160Nm of torque, tackle steep inclines with ease and confidence.\n\nConvenient Throttle: Enjoy full power when you need it, with the on-demand throttle providing an extra boost.\n\nSmooth Pedal Assist: Experience seamless pedal assist with the Cadence+Torque sensor, making every pedal stroke smooth and powerful.\n\nExtended Battery Life: Ride for longer and explore further with the included 52V 17Ah Battery (and charger), with the option to install a second battery for extended riding time.\n\nBenefits:\n\nUnmatched Maneuverability: Navigate rough terrain with precision and confidence, thanks to the specially designed MTB+ wheelset.\n\nEpic Performance: Conquer any trail with ease, powered by the robust Mid-drive Ultra motor and impressive torque output.\n\nComfortable Riding Experience: Enjoy a smooth and comfortable ride, even on the most challenging trails, with the full suspension frame.\n\nExtended Riding Time: Ride for longer and explore further with the extended battery life and the option to install a second battery.\n\nDon't let anything hold you back from your next off-road adventure.",
